# 500K total context, 6 concurrent sessions -- the "mid" profile.
# Sits between nvfp4-native (262K x 6, no YaRN) and nvfp4-long (1M x 3,
# YaRN factor 4) on the context-vs-concurrency tradeoff axis.
#
# Why 500K and not higher: shares the same total KV budget as the live
# nvfp4-long profile (6 x 500K = 3.0M distinct tokens ~= 3 x 1M), so peak
# prefill / KV pressure is comparable. The shared pool is ~4.5M tokens, so
# 6 x 700K (~4.2M, ~93%) would eat the reserve and risk preemption while
# 6 x 500K (~3.0M, ~67%) leaves a healthy margin.
#
# Prefix caching is ON so shared system/tool prefixes are counted once,
# lowering real usage well below the naive sum. YaRN factor 2.0 gives
# ~524K rope, comfortably above the 500K cap (guard re-forces YaRN off
# only at <= 262144, so 500K stays enabled).
MAX_MODEL_LEN=500000
YARN_ENABLE=true
YARN_FACTOR=2
MAX_NUM_SEQS=6
MAX_NUM_BATCHED_TOKENS=8192
QWEN_PREFIX_CACHE=true
EXTRA_VLLM_ARGS="--enable-prefix-caching --mamba-cache-mode align"
